@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity
@using VetWeb.Models
@inject SignInManager<ApplicationUser> SignInManager
@inject UserManager<ApplicationUser> UserManager
<ul class="navbar-nav">
@if (SignInManager.IsSignedIn(User))
{
    var usuario = await UserManager.GetUserAsync(User);
    <li class="nav-item">
        <span class="nav-link text-dark">Hola, @usuario?.Nombre @usuario?.Apellido</span>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item">
        <form asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Logout" method="post">
            <button type="submit" class="nav-link btn btn-link text-dark">Cerrar sesión</button>
        </form>
    </li>
}
else
{
    <li class="nav-item">
        <a class="nav-link text-dark" asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Login">Iniciar sesión</a>
    </li>
}
</ul>
